title: "SIESTA Input Builder & Post-DFT Analysis Studio"
abstract: "An interactive, open-source web application designed to streamline the operational lifecycle of SIESTA 5.x first-principles density functional theory (DFT) calculations: crystal structure manipulation, parameter configuration, pseudopotential matching, and comprehensive post-DFT analysis."
